an><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>標的</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>』、『</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(255, 2, 7);\"><strong>2</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>貴姓』、『</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(255, 2, 7);\"><strong>3</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>職業』、『</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(255, 2, 7);\"><strong>4</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>成員』、『</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(255, 2, 7);\"><strong>5</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>電話』、『</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(255, 2, 7);\"><strong>6</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>預約時間』</strong></span></p><p dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>✅✨註:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;若&nbsp;&nbsp;遲&nbsp;&nbsp;到&nbsp;&nbsp;達&nbsp;&nbsp;5&nbsp;&nbsp;分&nbsp;&nbsp;鐘&nbsp;&nbsp;視&nbsp;&nbsp;放&nbsp;&nbsp;棄&nbsp;&nbsp;不&nbsp;&nbsp;另&nbsp;&nbsp;通&nbsp;&nbsp;知&nbsp;(守信很重要)</strong></span></p><p dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: start;\">💖<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>本案</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(255, 2, 7);\"><strong>禁止抽菸、不養寵、不祭拜</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>，有正常工作者來承租使用。</strong></span></p><p dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong>『房屋優勢』:</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 204);\"><strong>房型很方正、室內很乾淨、空間很足夠、獨洗很衛生</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 204);\"><strong>捷運很鄰近、店家很林立、內裝很溫馨、配備很其全</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong>『條件限制』:</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>因為房客們的很優質很有水準基本素養也不錯，故希望找尋</strong></span><b